        <li>Apple handles refund requests and determines eligibility.</li>
        <li>Deleting ProcureCore or deleting a ProcureCore account does not cancel a subscription.</li>
        <li>Restoring a purchase may require the same Apple account used for the original purchase.</li>
        <li>Entitlement confirmation may be delayed while Apple, RevenueCat, and ProcureCore synchronise subscription state.</li>
